WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.734 --> 00:00:13.926
Jack and his Mother are on the street in front of Jack's house.

2
00:00:13.927 --> 00:00:16.367
Mother: Don't forget, Jack!

3
00:00:16.368 --> 00:00:20.034
Jack: Bye, Mom!

4
00:00:20.035 --> 00:00:22.251
Jack walks down the street.

5
00:00:22.252 --> 00:00:24.699
Lila and Mike ride by.

6
00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:27.698
Jack: Two tomatoes and milk.

7
00:00:27.699 --> 00:00:31.742
Lila: Hey, Jack! We're going to ride our bikes.

8
00:00:31.743 --> 00:00:34.406
Mike: Do you want to go to the park?

9
00:00:34.407 --> 00:00:36.987
Jack: No, I can't.

10
00:00:36.988 --> 00:00:40.349
Lila and Mike: See you later!

11
00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:45.268
Jack arrives at the supermarket.

12
00:00:45.269 --> 00:00:48.210
Jack: Two watermelons and milk?

13
00:00:48.211 --> 00:00:57.020
Or two cartons of milk and some eggs?

14
00:00:57.021 --> 00:01:00.375
Jack and his Mother are in the kitchen.

15
00:01:00.376 --> 00:01:04.514
Mother: Thank you, Jack. What is this?

16
00:01:04.515 --> 00:01:08.323
Two cucumbers and . . . bread?

17
00:01:08.324 --> 00:01:10.389
Jack: Sorry, Mom.

18
00:01:10.390 --> 00:01:15.658
Mother: Jack . . . you forgot again!

19
00:01:15.659 --> 00:01:19.342
Jack is on his way to the supermarket again.

20
00:01:19.343 --> 00:01:21.333
He sees a puppy.

21
00:01:21.334 --> 00:01:24.460
Jack: Oh, you're so cute!

22
00:01:24.461 --> 00:01:26.552
Pet store owner: Do you want to hold him?

23
00:01:26.553 --> 00:01:30.680
Jack holds the puppy.

24
00:01:30.681 --> 00:01:33.435
Jack returns home again.

25
00:01:33.436 --> 00:01:38.552
Mother: Jack . . . I said five lemons and a can of soup.

26
00:01:38.553 --> 00:01:40.822
Jack: I forgot, Mom.

27
00:01:40.823 --> 00:01:46.824
Mother: What am I going to do with oranges and a bar of soap?

28
00:01:46.825 --> 00:01:49.759
Jack's Mother is sick in bed.

29
00:01:49.760 --> 00:01:53.152
Father: Jack, can you run to the supermarket for me?

30
00:01:53.153 --> 00:01:54.828
Jack: Sure, Dad.

31
00:01:54.829 --> 00:01:59.967
Father: We need some chicken soup and orange juice.

32
00:01:59.968 --> 00:02:03.037
Jack tries hard not to forget.

33
00:02:03.038 --> 00:02:05.929
Jack: Chicken soup and orange juice.

34
00:02:05.930 --> 00:02:09.094
Chicken soup and orange juice.

35
00:02:09.095 --> 00:02:14.953
Mother (dreaming): Red roses, beautiful red roses.

36
00:02:14.954 --> 00:02:18.152
Father: Jack, don't forget what to buy!

37
00:02:18.153 --> 00:02:21.927
Jack: Chicken soup and orange juice.

38
00:02:21.928 --> 00:02:25.311
Jack walks quickly down the street.

39
00:02:25.312 --> 00:02:28.394
Mike: Hey, Jack! Let's go skateboarding!

40
00:02:28.395 --> 00:02:31.815
Pet store owner: Hi, Jack. Come inside and see the puppy!

41
00:02:31.816 --> 00:02:34.837
Jack: No, thank you. I have to go.

42
00:02:34.838 --> 00:02:37.284
Jack keeps walking.

43
00:02:37.285 --> 00:02:41.127
Jack: This time, I won't forget what to buy!

44
00:02:41.128 --> 00:02:46.358
Jack sees a bunch of flowers and remembers his Mother's words.

45
00:02:46.359 --> 00:02:51.038
Mother: Red roses, beautiful red roses.

46
00:02:51.039 --> 00:02:56.311
Jack: Oh, Mother would love these roses!

47
00:02:56.312 --> 00:02:58.530
Jack returns home.

48
00:02:58.531 --> 00:03:01.779
Father: Tomato soup and . . . ice cream.

49
00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:04.738
Jack! You forgot again!

50
00:03:04.739 --> 00:03:08.625
Jack looks down. He feels bad.

51
00:03:08.626 --> 00:03:11.389
Father: What are you hiding behind your back?

52
00:03:11.390 --> 00:03:14.401
He shows the flowers.

53
00:03:14.402 --> 00:03:17.884
Jack: I'm sorry I always forget.

54
00:03:17.885 --> 00:03:20.348
Father: What are those roses for?

55
00:03:20.349 --> 00:03:25.164
Mother: Roses? How did you know I wanted roses?

56
00:03:25.165 --> 00:03:26.914
Jack: I heard you.

57
00:03:26.915 --> 00:03:34.579
Mother: So you didn't forget the most important thing.

58
00:03:34.580 --> 00:03:37.865
Mother gives Jack a shopping list.

59
00:03:37.866 --> 00:03:41.019
Mother: Here is what I want you to buy, Jack.

60
00:03:41.020 --> 00:03:44.391
Jack: Now I will never forget what to buy.

61
00:03:44.392 --> 00:03:47.632
Jack may not remember everything.

62
00:03:47.633 --> 00:03:55.888
But he will never forget what is important.
